#: src/Telegram/HelpService.php:226
msgid ""
"/people – buttons: 🎁 give credits, 🏷 roles, organizers and passes, ✅ who may hold each role"
msgstr ""
"/people – knappar: 🎁 ge fribiljetter, 🏷 roller, arrangörer och undantag, ✅ vem som får ha varje roll"

#: src/Support/OrganizerGuide.php:247
msgid ""
"/people, in a private chat with the bot, also gives a one-time pass past the sign-up gate, makes someone an organizer (or stops them being one), and gives or takes away roles such as DJ or VJ. The People page in wp-admin and the Admin tab in the Crew app can do the same."
msgstr ""
"/people i en privat chatt med boten ger också ett engångsundantag förbi anmälningsspärren, gör någon till arrangör (eller tar bort det), och ger eller tar bort roller som DJ eller VJ. Sidan Personer i wp-admin och fliken Admin i Crew-appen kan göra samma sak."

#: src/Telegram/HelpService.php:215
msgid ""
"/roster [date] – who works that night; the sales desk marks 👋 arrived, organizers 👋 arrived, ✓ done, ⏰ late, ✗ no-show"
msgstr ""
"/roster [datum] – vem som jobbar den kvällen; försäljningsdisken markerar 👋 anlänt, arrangörer 👋 anlänt, ✓ klar, ⏰ sen, ✗ uteblev"

#: src/Support/OrganizerGuide.php:150
msgid ""
"/roster in a private chat with the bot shows the night's crew. Mark each person arrived, arrived late, completed or no-show, one by one or a whole crew at once. EventCrew > Roster in wp-admin does the same for any date. The night's welcome crew can mark the crew too."
msgstr ""
"/roster i en privat chatt med boten visar kvällens crew. Markera varje person som anländ, anländ sent, klar eller utebliven, en i taget eller ett helt crew på en gång. EventCrew > Närvaro i wp-admin gör samma sak för vilket datum som helst. Kvällens välkomstcrew kan också markera crewet."

#: src/Telegram/HelpService.php:228
msgid "/say text – post a message in the group; you see it first"
msgstr "/say text – posta ett meddelande i gruppen; du ser det först"

