#: templates/admin/settings.php:2372
msgid ""
"The site can read the import mailbox itself every five minutes. Use JMAP if your host blocks the IMAP ports; many shared hosts do. A message is marked read and moved to the Imported or Rejected folder once it has been dealt with."
msgstr ""
